<title>USA: Gables Residential to offer 1.5 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Gables Residential to offer 1.5 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gables Residential said on Wednesday it would offer 1.5 million shares of its common stock at a price of $23.625 per share.</p>
<p>The shares will be sold under a shelf registration statement with PaineWebber Inc as sole underwriter, the company said.</p>
<p>The net proceeds, about $33.5 million, will be used to repay floating rate debt.</p>
<p>The company did not state whether the shares would come from treasury stock or newly issued securities, and company spokesmen were not immediately available for further information.</p>
